ment system with real-time generative art capabilities. Iconic centerpiece for museums, corporate lobbies, and public plazas.\", \"sku\": \"BL-ART-SL3D\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/sculptled-sphere-3d\", \"category\": \"art-immersive\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_sculptled-sphere-3d.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/sculptled-sphere-3d\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"4mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"5000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What pixel pitch does the SculptLED Sphere 3D offer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The SculptLED Sphere 3D features a 4mm pixel pitch, delivering sharp and detailed imaging ideal for close and mid-range viewing distances.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What sizes are available for the SculptLED Sphere 3D?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This LED sphere display is available in diameters ranging from 1 meter up to 8 meters, allowing flexible customization to suit various installation spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the SculptLED Sphere 3D suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is IP65 rated, ensuring full protection against dust and water jets, making it ideal for outdoor public art installations and plazas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What content management system does the display use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It comes with a built-in generative content management system, enabling real-time creative content mapping tailored to the spherical surface for immersive visuals.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the SculptLED Sphere 3D compare to traditional flat LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike flat LEDs, this product offers a 360\\u00b0 omni-directional viewing experience with a custom-mapped pixel layout that ensures seamless content over a curved 3D surface, making it more engaging for public and artistic displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty and support does Brightluxx provide for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers industry-standard warranties covering parts and labor, alongside dedicated technical support to ensure optimal performance throughout the product lifecycle.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the SculptLED Sphere 3D be used indoors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, it is perfect for indoor locations like museum centerpieces and corporate lobbies where its bright, dynamic visuals enhance visitor engagement.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this spherical LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation requires a structurally secure mounting surface with access to power and data connectivity. Brightluxx provides professional installation services to optimize setup and calibration.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"SculptLED Sphere 3D\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/sculptled-sphere-3d\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"o